  "2026-11-19T13:58:22.641Z",codex-sol,"Round DT applies the owner-approved name and retains the approved noreply address. The public Git history remains intact. I will verify the tracker redactions, author mapping, and package gates."
  "2026-11-19T14:07:10.515Z",codex-sol,"The tracker verified the redaction with zero seal mismatches. The independent history-prefix gate rejected the intentional rewrite because it currently accepts only byte-prefix appends and verified lossless re-anchors. The test fixtures, package typecheck, documentation tests, and commit evidence checks pass."
  "2026-11-19T14:07:46.694Z",codex-sol,The history-prefix gate policy is tracked in pm-rust-history-redaction-prefix. The identity change keeps the existing gate intact.
  "2026-11-19T14:07:54.915Z",codex-sol,"Verified the item snapshot and history redaction, the Rust typecheck, the linked fixture and changelog tests, the documentation tests, the all-object identity audit, and the fresh-clone evidence check. The tracker health check passed with clone-local merge drivers. The history-prefix gate reports the separately tracked policy conflict."
